    "35f66677-75c7-450b-a23d-33cc18a30274": {
      "type": "theme-section__visual-text",
      "settings": {
        "row_spacing_inner_top": "xs",
        "row_spacing_inner_bottom": "md",
        "section_background_color": "lpink",
        "section_background_color_b": "lpink",
        "section_background_color_direction": "image-up",
        "section_background_size": "lg",
        "page_width": "page-width--narrow",
        "layout_order": "text-image",
        "use_animations": true,
        "section_image": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/IMG_2196.jpg",
        "section_image_size": "original",
        "section_image_rounded_corners": "xl",
        "this_heading": "Van Deo-merk naar Verzorgingsmerk",
        "this_content": "<p>Hoewel we inmiddels vooral bekend zijn als deo-merk, realiseerden we ons dat de missie groter was. We willen de hele badkamerroutine verduurzamen met fijne, natuurlijke producten. Daarom voegden we oceaan-vriendelijke zonnebrand, natuurlijke lippenbalsem en superzachte hand & body bars toe aan het assortiment. Terug naar de roots.<\/p><p><\/p>",
        "text_box_position": "center-left",
        "block_heading_font_size": "xl",
        "block_heading_font_color": "red",
        "block_text_font_size": "xs",
